\f1\fs22 In the pre-dawn darkness, a massive government operation unfolds around Sublime Point. Gerry Hardman's TRAMP forces approach from the north through established access roads, while Dunhilton's off-the-books mercenary units position themselves along the cliff faces and helicopter landing zones. A third contingent\'97regular Ulyssian Defence Force units ostensibly conducting "training exercises"\'97forms an outer perimeter, ensuring no civilian interference and providing plausible deniability.\
